  1237                                  ; POST keyboard/controller initialization -----------------------------------
  1238                                  keyboard_init:
  1239 000007C4 50                          push ax
  1240 000007C5 53                          push bx
  1241 000007C6 51                          push cx
  1242 000007C7 52                          push dx
