  1416                                  ; Runtime keyboard helpers ---------------------------------------------------
  1417                                  ; These helpers operate with DS = BDA_SEG.  They use the same physical
  1418                                  ; controller/keyboard command path POST used; no host-side state is consulted.
  1419                                  
  1420                                  ; AL = byte to send to the keyboard.  Wait for ACK, retry on RESEND.
  1421                                  ; Returns CF set on timeout/error.  Keyboard command responses bypass the
  1422                                  ; 8042 scan-code translator in Keyboard Reality Brick 2.
