  4847                                  ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  4848                                  ; Cromwell AT CMOS Setup
  4849                                  ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  4850                                  ; The setup program lives in the system ROM, as it did on late AT-compatible
  4851                                  ; motherboards. CMOS byte 20h is OEM configuration RAM covered by the normal
  4852                                  ; 10h-20h checksum: bit 0 is boot Num Lock and bit 1 selects HDD-first boot.
  4853                                  
  4854                                  setup_entry_window:
  4855 00002446 50                          push ax
  4856 00002447 53                          push bx
  4857 00002448 51                          push cx
  4858 00002449 52                          push dx
  4859 0000244A 1E                          push ds
